## Confluence Sub-folder Page IDs (optional)

> Only needed if publishing resolution guides to Confluence.
> Leave blank to save guides locally to `output/guides/` instead.
> Fill in after your first `/sre-triage` run, or look up IDs in your Confluence space.

| Folder | parentId |
|---|---|
| Ticket Resolutions (root) | `{fill in}` |
| Deploy & Release | `{fill in}` |
| Secrets & Credentials | `{fill in}` |
| Debug & Incidents | `{fill in}` |
| New Resources & Onboarding | `{fill in}` |
| DNS & Zero Trust | `{fill in}` |
| Infrastructure Changes | `{fill in}` |

## Triage Dashboard (optional)

> Only needed if maintaining the dashboard in Confluence.
> Leave blank to use `output/dashboard/triage-dashboard.md` instead.

| Page | pageId |
|---|---|
| SRE Triage Dashboard | `{fill in after first run}` |

## Observability URLs

> Update to match your monitoring stack.

